      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Half Moon Brutemaster is named a rank six peak Gu Immortal of the moon path who joins a clash drawn by Pi Shui Han’s fight. He holds an Immortal Gu that can pierce space and open a pathway into Jade Pool blessed land, and he unleashes a killer move when Fang Yuan’s group enters through that hole.",
