        "char_pi_shui_han",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yin Wu Que inherits the inheritance of an Olden Antiquity moon path Gu Immortal great expert and fights with a complete moon path combat system. Killer moves such as Crescent Moon Thrust, Moon Rise, and moonblade methods produce crescent moonblades. A waxing crescent moon in the sky amplifies his moon path killer moves, and when those moves are destroyed or countered the lingering moon path dao marks are absorbed so the crescent grows toward a full moon that raises his offense and defense to their strongest state.",
